# Sandswirl Wanderglyph: "Each opponent who attacked you or a planeswalker you control this turn can't cast spells." With three
# players, only an attack whose defending player is the Wanderglyph's controller counts (CR 506.2, 508.1b): Bot2's Ornithopter
# attacks Bot3, and its Savannah Lions attack Invasion of Gobakhan, a battle Bot1 protects - Bot1 is that attack's defending
# player, but a battle is neither "you" nor a planeswalker, so it is no attack on Bot1 (the card's text names only those two).
# Bot2 then casts Lightning Bolt at Bot3. Turn two: Bot2 casts the Lions, the Ornithopter and the Siege, choosing Bot1 to
# protect it; turn four Bot1 crafts the Glyphbridge with its Black Lotus.

